## Codebase Structure

* **`{{.EntitiesConfig.Dir}}/`**: Go structs for the data models, plus `types/` and
  `mapper/` helpers{{ if .ValidationEnabled }} and per-entity `Validate()` methods backed by the shared
  `{{.EntitiesConfig.Dir}}/validation/` package{{ end }}. Fully regenerated on every run.
* **`enums/`**: Go constants and helpers for the schema's enums.
{{- if .ProtoConfig.Enabled }}
* **`{{.ProtoConfig.Dir}}/`**: Protocol Buffer definitions and the generated gRPC stubs
  (`{{.ProtoConfig.Dir}}/gen`){{ if .ProtoConfig.Server }}, plus the gRPC server in `{{.ProtoConfig.Dir}}/server`{{ end }}.
{{- end }}
{{- if .CoreConfig.Enabled }}
* **`{{.CoreConfig.CoreDir}}/`**: The business-logic layer.
  * **`{{.CoreConfig.CoreDir}}/{{.CoreConfig.RepoConfig.Dir}}/`**: Database access generated via `sqlc`
    (`sql/schema`, `sql/queries` and the generated `gen/` code).
  * **`{{.CoreConfig.CoreDir}}/module/<entity>/`**: CRUD per entity — fetch by index, list with
    pagination, insert/update/upsert, delete.
{{- if .CoreConfig.EventsConfig.Enabled }}
  * **`{{.CoreConfig.CoreDir}}/{{.CoreConfig.EventsConfig.Dir}}/`**: Change events emitted on writes ({{.CoreConfig.EventsConfig.Transport}}).
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if and .RESTConfig.Enabled .CoreConfig.Enabled }}
* **`{{.RESTConfig.Dir}}/`**: REST API — chi router, handlers, middleware{{ if .RESTConfig.OpenAPI }} and the OpenAPI
  spec at `{{.RESTConfig.Dir}}/openapi.yaml`{{ end }}.
{{- end }}
{{- if .AuthConfig.Enabled }}
* **`auth/`**: {{ if .HasJWTAuth }}JWT auth server (signin / refresh / validate){{ else }}Keycloak (OIDC) middleware{{ end }}.
{{- end }}
{{- if .StorageConfig.Enabled }}
* **`storage/`**: S3 file storage — `POST /upload` (multipart) and `POST /sign`
  (presigned URL), plus a small S3 client. Credentials come from the `aws:` config
  block at runtime.
{{- end }}
{{- if not .InfoConfig.Disabled }}
* **`info/`**: Self-documenting "what's deployed" HTML page served at the HTTP root `/`.
{{- end }}
* **`config/`**: Configuration loading plus `base.yaml` / `cli.yaml`. **Regenerated in
  full on every run** — never keep secrets or hand-edits here; supply real values at
  deploy time (or via the `CONFIG` / `ENV` environment variables).
* **`main.go`**: Entrypoint; wires every enabled component with Uber Fx.
{{- if .CustomConfig.Enabled }}
* **`{{.CustomConfig.Dir}}/`**: The user-owned custom application zone (see above) — the
  only directory here that is not overwritten.
{{- end }}
{{- if or .DockerConfig.Enabled .HelmConfig.Enabled }}
* **{{ if .DockerConfig.Enabled }}`Dockerfile`{{ end }}{{ if and .DockerConfig.Enabled .HelmConfig.Enabled }} & {{ end }}{{ if .HelmConfig.Enabled }}`{{.HelmConfig.Dir}}/`{{ end }}**: Containerization and deployment assets.
{{- end }}
{{- if .GitHubActionsConfig.Enabled }}
* **`.github/workflows/`**: CI — build and publish the image on push to `{{.GitHubActionsConfig.MainBranch}}`.
{{- end }}
* **`.nuzur-codegen-manifest.json`**: Inventory of every generated file. Used to clean
  up files that are no longer generated; user-added files are never listed.

